    "text": "The mean of the numbers <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>10</mn></math>&nbsp;is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn></math>&nbsp;and their variance is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8</mn></math>. If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi></math>&nbsp;is the mean deviation of the numbers about the mean, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>25</mn><mi>M</mi></math>&nbsp;is equal to",
