  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Mean&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>x</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math>&nbsp;(given)&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Variance&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>&#8721;</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mi>n</mi></mfrac><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><mover><mi>x</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>8</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>6</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8</mn></math>&nbsp;(given)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi>ii</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>on solving equations&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>ii</mi></mfenced></math>, we get&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p>Now, Mean deviation about Mean&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>&#8721;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>x</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mi>n</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>12</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>12</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>25</mn><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>60</mn></math>.</p>",
